From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] egl: find libEGL opened without a version

gl4es (and other loaders) dlopen "libEGL.so", so the loaded object is
named /usr/lib/libEGL.so and matches none of the "*libEGL.so.*"
patterns. get_egl_proc_address then finds no eglGetProcAddress, the
RTLD_NEXT fallback finds nothing either (libEGL was opened with
RTLD_LOCAL), and MangoHud's eglGetDisplay hook returns NULL: the
program crashes (PortMaster's Perfect Dark on gl4es).

---
--- a/src/gl/inject_egl.cpp
+++ b/src/gl/inject_egl.cpp
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ static void* get_egl_proc_address(const char* name) {
     static void *(*pfn_eglGetProcAddress)(const char*) = nullptr;
     const char *libs[] = {
         "*libEGL.so.*",
+        "*libEGL.so",
         "*libEGL_mesa.so.*",
         "*libEGL_nvidia.so.*"
     };
